        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description1"><![CDATA[Thank you for your trust in my recommendation of <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and maybe you would like to try it out. It's important to know that I very consciously choose the products that I am convinced of myself. You are welcome to leave your feedback in the community.]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description2"><![CDATA[Thank you for your trust! I cordially invite you to visit <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and consider my recommendation. It is a personal concern of mine to only select products that I am absolutely convinced of. Your feedback is always welcome in my community. Try it out and see for yourself!]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description3"><![CDATA[Thank you for your trust that you would like to take a look at my recommendation from <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and perhaps try it out. It's important to know that I very consciously choose the products that I am convinced of myself. You are welcome to leave your feedback with me. I cordially invite you to try it out and see for yourself!]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description4"><![CDATA[Thank you for your trust! I cordially invite you to visit <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and consider my recommendation. I carefully select products that I am convinced of myself. Your feedback is especially important to me, so I'm glad if you share it in the community and among friends and family.]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description5"><![CDATA[I appreciate your trust and would like to invite you to visit <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and discover my recommendations. I consciously choose products that convince me personally. Feel free to share your feedback with me, because your opinion is very important to me!]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description6"><![CDATA[A heartfelt thank you for your trust! I would like to invite you to visit <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and consider my carefully selected recommendations. As a convinced user of these products, it is important to me that you get to know them too. Feel free to let me know your feedback in the community!]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description7"><![CDATA[Thanks to your trust, I would like to encourage you to visit <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and explore my recommendations. I only select products that have convinced me personally. Your feedback is important to me, so I'm happy if you share it with me in the community.]]></item>
        <item name="wcf.urlshort.redirect.description8"><![CDATA[Your trust means a lot to me, so I invite you to visit <a href="{$url->url}">{if $discount|isset && $discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)}{@$discount->getImageTag(16, $url->url)} {/if}{$extractedTitle}</a> and discover my selected recommendations. As a strong advocate of these products, I would like you to consider them too. Feel free to share your feedback with me in the community, because I value your opinion!]]></item>
